    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "B 757\nAmerica West Airlines\n....\n. . . .\nIf you are seated in an exit seat and do not understand\nspoken English or the information contained in this\nsafety card, please notify one of our employees.\nSi usted está sentado en una fila de salida y no entiende\ninglés o la información en esta tarjeta de seguridad,\ncomuniquese con uno de nuestros empleados.\nPlease do not remove this card from airplane.\nPor favor, deje esta tarjeta en el avión.\nFollow these instructions, the directions of crew members,\nand placarded signs.\nWAmerica West Airlines\nSAFETY INFORMATION\nB 757",
      "NO SMOKING No fumar\nNO SMOKING\nNo smoking at any\ntime while this\nlight is illuminated.\nOXYGEN\nOxigeno\nQuickly!\nSEAT BELTS\nCinturones de seguridad\nFASTEN SEAT BELT\n1/111\nFasten seat belt and\nremain seated while\nthis sign is illuminated\nOVERHEAD COMPARTMENTS\n2\nOK\nDO NOT USE\nNo utilizar\nTAKE OFF/LANDING\n2002.127.071\nSAFETY INFORMATION\nB 757",
      "0 0 00020\n#960599\nCopyright © America West Airlines\n7/93 Printed in U.S.A."
    ],
